<style>
    #lesscountmembersdiv, #messcountmembersdiv {
        display: none;
    }

    ol {
        list-style-type: none;
        counter-reset: item;
        padding: 10px;
        margin: 0;
    }

        ol li {
            counter-increment: item;
            position: relative;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

            ol li::marker {
                content: counter(item) ".";
                font-size: 24px;
                margin-right: 10px;
            }

            ol li p {
                font-size: 21px;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                line-height: 1;
            }

    table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse; /* Ensures table borders are merged */
    }

    tr {
        border-bottom: 10px solid transparent; /* Adds space between rows */
    }

    td {
        padding: 0px; /* Adds padding inside each cell */
    }
</style>


<div class="container" style="padding-left:70px;padding-right:75px;margin-top:255px; font-family: 'Times New Roman';">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-4">
            @*<img class="img-fluid" src="~/img/urbanLogo.jpg" />*@
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-4 text-center">
            @* <div class="qrcode-container" style="text-align: center;">
            <div class="qrcode" style="display:inline-block;margin-left: 30px; margin-bottom:1rem"></div>
            </div> *@
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="col-sm-4">
            <div style="font-size: 22px;">
                <span><b></b></span>
                <span style="
       margin-left: 10px;
       min-width: 160px;
       float: right;
     " class="pppdate">@DateTime.Now.ToString("dd MMMM, yyyy")</span>
                <div style="clear: both"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-9">
            <p style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: bold;">
                To:
            </p>
            <div class="lesscountmembersdiv">
                <p style="padding-left: 20px; font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                    <span class="pmemberNameAndDetails"></span>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="messcountmembersdiv">
                <p style="padding-left: 20px; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                    <span class="pmemberNameAndDetails"></span>
                </p>
            </div>
            <p class="ppermanentAddress" style="padding-left: 20px;font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 0;"></p>
            <p class="pbuyerPhone" style="padding-left: 20px;font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 0;"></p>
           @*  <p class="pmembershipNo" style="padding-left: 20px;font-size: 21px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0; "></p> *@

        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-3">
            <div class="imgContainerForPrint" style="float: right; margin-right:0px; height: 160px;width:160px">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-1 mt-2">
            <p>
                <b style="font-size: 22px">Subj:</b>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-11 mt-2 ms-2">
            <span style=" margin-left: 10px;
                border-bottom: 1px solid black;
                font-size: 23px;
              font-weight: bold;">
                Allotment Letter of <span class="ptype"></span>
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12 mt-2 mb-5" style="text-align:justify;">
            <ol style="padding-left: 7px;">

                <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
                    <p style="font-size:21px;">
                        The Management is pleased to inform that you have been allotted under mentioned <span class="ptype"></span> dated
                        <span class="ppdate"></span> vide Ref No <span class="pregistrationNo"></span>.
                    </p>

                    <table style="margin-top:10px; font-size:21px; font-weight: bold;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="width:200px;">a.&nbsp;&nbsp;Vill No:</td>
                            <td><span class="ppropertyNo"></span></td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td>b.&nbsp;&nbsp;Sector:</td>
                            <td><span class="psector"></span></td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td>c.&nbsp;&nbsp;Phase:</td>
                            <td><span class="pphase"></span></td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td>d.&nbsp;&nbsp;Size:</td>
                            <td><span class="parea"></span></td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>

                </li>

                <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
                    <p style="font-size:21px;">
                        N-Stack reserves the right to make adjustment and relocate the plot, if need arises due to site constraints or change in town planning.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
                    <p style="font-size:21px;">
                        That transferee/allottee agree to pay development charges as and when demanded by the Authority on account of any additional development / up gradation of services or infrastructure.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
                    <p style="font-size:21px;">
                        Any Tax imposed by Federal/Provincial Government shall be payable by the current owner as and when enforced.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li style="padding-left:0.5rem;">
                    <p style="font-size:21px;">
                        We assure you of our best cooperation at all times.
                    </p>
                </li>

            </ol>

        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-6">
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-6">
            <p style="font-size: 22px; line-height:1!important; text-align:right;"><span class="pSignatoryRank"></span></p>
            <p style="font-size: 22px; line-height:1!important; text-align:right;"><span class="pSignatoryDesignation"></span></p>
            <p style="font-size: 22px; line-height:1!important; text-align:right;">(<span class="pSignatoryName"></span>)</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" style="">
        <div class="col-sm-9">
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-3">
            <p style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; position: fixed; bottom: 22px;">
                <b><span class="InternalNo"></span></b>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>